  "releaseNotes": "Simplified the UX - instead of enforcing the verbose builder for telephone number can now use the ctor.Simplified the naming of methods as well. Added better JSON support especially for EmailAddress and TelephoneNumber. Pulled EmergencyTelephoneNumber to separate class. TelephoneNumber now inherits from TelephoneNumberBase to accomodate EmergencyTelephoneNumber. Mostly concerned about adding JSON support in this major version.",
